{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1362944-2e-scelesti","id":1362944,"title":"2E Scelesti","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-23T13:33:05-08:00","id":1362944,"title":"2E Scelesti","content":"I know that official rules for these guys will be in Nameless and Accursed, but has anyone come up with a good temporary version based off the Core and Left Handed? I\u2019ve looked at it some, but without having played 1e I\u2019m not sure how it would work exactly. Particularly the Paradox control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/565-therian","name":"Therian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T08:44:08-08:00","id":1363088,"title":"","content":"Maybe you could approximate something with the Prelacy rules. If the Elder Diadem gives them power over Paradox, but the nameless lords of the Abyss can kill them with a snap, then that could be a more dangerous version of Mystery Commands (like 1 aggravated wound per day they don't work towards the goal).<br /> <br /> Crown allows them to have a Rank amongst Abyssal creatures, which is equal to the arcanum of the sponsor, verge or artifact that granted their power. Maybe they stole or won the power from a being. Spirit seems like the easiest, making it affect the entities, including countering it or even dispelling Abyssal Numina if they have Prime.<br /> <br /> The Sword lets them control Paradox within sensory range. They can manipulate up to the Arcanum's rating in Paradox Reach per turn.<br /> <br /> The 